To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Colares', '127 Demo Street, Colares, Lisbon', 38.793727937140595, -9.459949179901114, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.462527, 38.790259), 4326)::geography, 10, false, 0, 5, 7, 6.5, 1290.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (55, 57, 'Alcantara Terrace by Gt House', 'In the Alcantara-Junqueira area, very close to Belem, with capacity for 4 people, the Alcantara Terrace is a 55m2 apartment, recently renovated and decorated with great taste, with a wonderful 150m2 terrace with barbecue and garden furniture for a perfect relaxation at the end of the day.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Alcntara', '155 Demo Street, Alcntara, Lisbon', 38.7039, -9.18975, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.188343, 38.704906), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 108.09, 14.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (56, 58, 'Cosy Studio In Chiado area#', 'Experience Lisbon from this stylish and well-appointed studio in the iconic Chiado district. Ideal for solo travelers or couples, the apartment features a comfortable double bed, private bathroom, fully equipped kitchen, and washing machine. Located in the city''s vibrant and central area, just steps from renowned landmarks, charming cafés, shops, and excellent public transport. Please note, due to its prime location, some ambient city noise may be expected during your stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '178 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.7092126, -9.1458979, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.148923, 38.708581), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 68.0, 20.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (57, 59, 'Lisbon downtown Boa Nova Guesthouse 6', 'Freshly renovated building , lodging this historical Guesthouse with religious background and own little charming chapel for those who decide to visit Portugal for religious reasons or wish to have a stay attached to a different concept.
This small Guesthouse is located in the center of Lisbon, with an amazing view over Lisbon downtown and newly renovated bathrooms and bedrooms'' floors.
Great starting point to discover Lisbon!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '18 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.72322, -9.13737, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.140388, 38.722488), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 83.0, 9.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (58, 60, 'Third floor apartment at Graça', 'Third floor apartment , with no elevator. up to 4 guests. one Room with a double bed and 2 single beds located at the open space area. Great Location – 5/10 minutes to reach Historical center! Next to several interesting Points – Graça Square and ViewPoint, FleaMarket, Senhora do Monte ViewPoint, Alfama neighborhood, Saint George Castle, Portas do Sol ViewPoint and so much more! SPOILER ALERT: At 300 meters you will find a stop for the famous 28 TRAM – Historical Tram.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '63 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.71819, -9.12791, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.128059, 38.715589), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 115.0, 31.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (59, 61, 'Seafront Private Condo & Big Terrace', 'This is an ample 3 bedroom apartment, in the 5th and last level of a private condominium, with elevator, with a large terrace facing the ocean and Marina Oeiras. 
The house has a lot of natural light and has all the utilities you need to have a comfortable stay. 
We also have all accessories for a baby. 
Excellent location between Lisbon and Cascais, situated near academic institutions and investigation center. The train station is just in front of the building.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Oeiras e S.Julio da Barra, Pao de Arcos e Caxias', '51 Demo Street, Oeiras e S.Julio da Barra, Pao de Arcos e Caxias, Lisbon', 38.68534, -9.31154, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.310112, 38.685808), 4326)::geography, 7, false, 0, 3, 6, 2.0, 308.5, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (60, 62, 'Cozy Room in Organic Farm', 'Registration Details
54266/AL', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'S.Maria, S.Miguel, S.Martinho, S.Pedro Penaferrim', '150 Demo Street, S.Maria, S.Miguel, S.Martinho, S.Pedro Penaferrim, Lisbon', 38.82253, -9.43451, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.439192, 38.820093), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.5, 46.0, 10.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (61, 63, 'Maria José''s Apartment - Room w/ private bathroom', 'Cosy bedroom with Balcony inserted in a four-bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor, with shared kitchen and bathroom. The building has 2 elevators, so there is no need to climb stairs.

Just outside your door, there is a lot of commerce, restaurants and supermarkets within 3 min walking distance. The Subway and the bus station are also within 4min walking.

You might have some flatmates during your stay, which might be a great way to make new friends in this lovely city.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '101 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.72516, -9.13238, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.134914, 38.725118), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 73.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (62, 64, 'Central & Vintage appartment', 'Cozy apartment, refurbished to make it comfortable, but keeping the ancient style of old Lisbon. Very well located, next to the viewpoint of São Pedro de Alcântara, one of the best views in Lisbon, between Príncipe Real and Chiado.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '136 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.71466276518036, -9.145280535908151, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.141731, 38.714385), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 114.0, 12.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (63, 65, 'Cascais Dream-Sunny Orange Room', 'Deluxe Double — Sunny Orange Room with Private Bath

Relax in this spacious double room with warm orange décor and plenty of light. Perfect for couples wanting comfort and easy beach access.
• Size: 18m²
• Sleeps: 2 guests
• Private bathroom', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Cascais e Estoril', '170 Demo Street, Cascais e Estoril, Lisbon', 38.69736, -9.42222, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.418945, 38.697956), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 126.0, 20.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (64, 66, 'MY LX FLAT Stunning and Bright 2BR Apartment', 'Welcome to your elegant retreat in the heart of Lisbon! This beautifully designed 2-bedroom (one of them suite), 2-bathroom apartment is located just two steps away from the iconic Avenida da Liberdade — Lisbon’s most prestigious boulevard, known for its luxury shopping, fine dining, and charming cafés.

Flooded with natural light throughout the day, the apartment features large windows and an open layout that creates a warm, inviting atmosphere.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santo Antnio', '161 Demo Street, Santo Antnio, Lisbon', 38.72181, -9.14614, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.146776, 38.720376), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 2.0, 378.5, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (65, 67, 'Renew Yourself at an Unvarnished City Hideaway', 'Cozy, light-filled retreat in Lisbon, ideal for 4 guests. This renovated apartment in Olaias features 2 bedrooms, a private balcony with stunning views, and a calming décor. Just minutes from the метро, it’s the perfect base to explore the city. Enjoy an authentic stay with comfort and vibrant atmosphere.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Beato', '123 Demo Street, Beato, Lisbon', 38.738051, -9.122106, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.123923, 38.738145), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 140.98, 44.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (66, 68, 'Farmhouse Village Apt · Near Lisbon · Fast WiFi', 'Stay in a real Portuguese village where there''s a bakery, café, vineyards and local life just outside your door—while still being only 20 minutes from beaches and 45 minutes from Lisbon.

This two-bedroom apartment sits in the heart of Freiria. Enjoy a coffee & a pastel de nata breakfast like a local and be surfing at Ericeira or exploring Mafra''s UNESCO palace within 20 mins. 

This is the perfect place to rest & recharge for a few days and still be close to all that greater Lisbon has to offer', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Freiria', '161 Demo Street, Freiria, Lisbon', 39.022903710142714, -9.320682954631033, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.318586, 39.020207), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 83.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (67, 69, 'Villa Terra da Eira-Sea view', '"Villa Terra da Eira" sea view. Upper floor. Ideal for 2 people. Exterior entrance and fully independent: bedroom, bathroom, living room, terrace with sea view and swimming pool. THERE IS NO KITCHEN, but the space has a refrigerator, microwave, kettle, toaster, and coffee machine for light meals. There are many restaurants, take-away, with home delivery. 60 km from Lisbon, 1 km from the beach, Areia Branca and the city center. 8 km from Dinopark. Óbidos, Sintra,', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Maxial e Monte Redondo', '102 Demo Street, Maxial e Monte Redondo, Lisbon', 39.14497, -9.19525, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.194024, 39.144519), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 108.0, 31.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (68, 70, 'Cheese & Wine | Alfama - Sto. Estevão Viewpoint 1', 'Step into history in this unique apartment within a 17th-century palace, located in the heart of Alfama, one of Lisbon’s most iconic neighborhoods. Ideal for a couple and two children, it’s just steps from the Santo Estêvão Viewpoint, offering stunning city and river views. Explore the narrow streets, visit the Fado Museum, and walk to the Cathedral and Castle. 
The apartment is on the 2nd floor and may not be suitable for those with walking difficulties.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '58 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.71153, -9.12946, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.13222, 38.712829), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 3, 1.0, 389.0, 75.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (69, 71, 'Almirante GuestHouse - Quarto7', 'Located in the heart of Lisbon in one of the noblest areas of the city, this apartment provides all the amenities you could wish for during your stay.
With 7 bedrooms (all with natural light), 2 bathrooms, kitchen (fully equipped including dishwasher and washing machine) and common living room.
All rooms are equipped with a single bed (linen included), desk, wardrobe, TV, fan and Wi-Fi internet in all rooms!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '163 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.73129, -9.13419, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.138356, 38.728803), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 52.0, 15.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (70, 72, 'Origens Apartment: Close to City Center & Cascais', 'Very nice apartment in a quiet neighborhood with excellent access to the city center (15min), Belém (10min), Cascais (20min) and Sintra (30min).

Located in a residential neighborhood, it is perfect for couples, solo adventures and families with children. The apartment is close to a supermarket, cafés, restaurants, banks, a laundrette and more.

It is also very close to the bus stop to the city center, Algés - where there is the train to Cais do Sodré and/or Cascais!

Caxias beach (2.8km)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Algs, Linda-a-Velha e Cruz Quebrada-Dafundo', '107 Demo Street, Algs, Linda-a-Velha e Cruz Quebrada-Dafundo, Lisbon', 38.71053, -9.24787, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.248748, 38.709584), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 2, 2, 1.0, 127.67, 29.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (71, 73, 'Estrela House With View by Local', 'The light, the view, the terrace with a magnificent view of Lisbon, will be in your memory when you leave this apartment.
 Situated in a privileged area of ​​Lisbon, with several attractive points.A fully equipped kitchen to prepare your meals and a wonderful terrace to enjoy a glass of wine in the late afternoon. The apartment is located in a building, on a third floor without an elevator.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Campo de Ourique', '72 Demo Street, Campo de Ourique, Lisbon', 38.71614, -9.15548, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.15431, 38.7197), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 254.5, 75.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (72, 74, 'Maria Studio@Bica & Bairro Alto - Renovated', 'A very comfortable and fully equipped 50 square meters studio, in a 18TH century public courtyard . In the heart of Lisbon. Our House is just a few minutes walk from the Ribeira (Timeout Market), S. Paulo Street, Cais do Sodré, Bica, Chiado, Bairro Alto, Praça do Comércio. In the old times our home was a tavern, converted some years ago in studios, with all needs to spend some good days in Lisbon.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '155 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.70873, -9.14856, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.150893, 38.709827), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 131.67, 46.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (73, 66, 'MY LX FLAT Graça Lighting Design Apartment', 'This is a bright and design apartment in a new building located in Graça, one of the hipsters and coolest neighborhoods in Lisbon! In this apartment you will have all the comfort in the middle of the historical area.
You are close the most beautiful viewpoints in Lisbon like “Miradouro Senhora do Monte” and “Miradouro da Graça”. Walking distance from interesting view points and markets like “Igreja da Graça” where you have one of the best views in the city and the market “Feira da Ladra”.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '99 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.72127, -9.1293, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.129696, 38.716975), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 231.0, 41.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (74, 75, 'Belém 2 BDR/ By 2 Unesco sites/ free parking zone', 'Families love this flat on a quiet street with free parking.
It''s only 15 min. walk from Jerónimos Monastery and Belem Tower (UNESCO sites). There are lots of museums nearby.
and the famous historic Nata shop .The riverside gardens often have weekend markets. You''ll be 10 min. by train from Cais do Sodre and 20 from Carcavelos beach. Caparica beach can be reached by a direct boat. 

Travelliing with kids under 13? They don''t pay tourism tax of 4€ /night, so ask airbnb not to charge you.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Belm', '36 Demo Street, Belm, Lisbon', 38.701271057128906, -9.203004837036133, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.206817, 38.701952), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 126.23, 34.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (75, 76, 'Bright Coastal Duplex Apartment with Terrace', 'Smith&Adams Property Management is solely responsible for offering this listing on Airbnb, and they host as a business. For more legal information, visit our Help Center.

Business name: Choise2Choise Unipessoal Lda
Business registry: Business register
NIPC number: 6872-7117-2557
