To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Ajuda', '17 Demo Street, Ajuda, Lisbon', 38.70597, -9.18971, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.192117, 38.703876), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 2.0, 158.5, 54.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (76, 77, 'Quarto Privado - Colombo', 'Quiet place and close to all kinds of shops.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Pontinha e Fames', '83 Demo Street, Pontinha e Fames, Lisbon', 38.76553542454367, -9.200422503054142, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.2014, 38.767074), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 27.0, 7.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (77, 78, 'Authentic Lisbon Stay Next to Graça & Viewpoints', 'Perfectly located in Lisbon’s charming Graça neighborhood, this cosy 1st-floor apartment is set on a quiet street just steps from local cafés, bakeries, and traditional restaurants. Explore nearby viewpoints, the National Pantheon, and Feira da Ladra market, with easy access to Alfama and downtown by bus. The 1-bedroom apartment sleeps 2 guests and features full air conditioning for a comfortable stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '86 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.7214922, -9.1249384, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.11968, 38.723062), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 87.8, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (78, 79, 'Charming Lisbon 1BD Apartment', 'Greetings from my humble abode! Nestled within the historical heart of Lisbon, at Baixa-Chiado, you''ll discover my charming one-bedroom apartment, a cozy haven capable of accommodating up to four guests.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '36 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.7126, -9.14124, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.145399, 38.712975), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 136.0, 28.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (79, 80, 'Lisbon Liberty Apartments II', 'If you are looking for a place to live during your stay in Lisbon. This apartment located 7 minutes by walk from the downtown and very close to Avenida da Liberdade, It can be a very interesting time to choose option.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santo Antnio', '119 Demo Street, Santo Antnio, Lisbon', 38.72383, -9.14393, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.140637, 38.722599), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 160.0, 30.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (80, 81, 'Arsenal 108 - 3E', 'Harmony and charisma in the center of Lisbon. Modern, charming, clean and comfortable 1 bedroom apartment, in a building with elevator and WIFI. Close to public transport and all kinds of commerce and services, including supermarket. Just a few minutes'' walk from several tourist attractions in the city, and the stop for the historic tram 28, Chiado and the Tagus river. With everything you need for a memorable stay in Lisbon, whether on vacation or work. Ideal for stays of 1 or 2 and families', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '64 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.70839, -9.13976, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.135432, 38.70749), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 166.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (81, 82, 'Studio 10 min walk from beach', 'New studio in a calm neighborhood in estoril, walking distance from train station to Lisbon and Cascais and walking distance from the beach.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Cascais e Estoril', '63 Demo Street, Cascais e Estoril, Lisbon', 38.70112, -9.37713, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.377051, 38.697896), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 114.5, 17.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (82, 83, 'Motorhome Om Free 4', 'Welcome to the best way to get to know Portugal, with its more than 1600 kms of coastline. Live the experience of waking up to stunning landscapes, in the middle of nature and away from the crowds. 
It''s about where they want to wake up!
Wellcome to the best way to discover this beautiful country, plant near the sea and it’s 1600 kms of coastline. Live the experience of waking up with stunnishing landscapes, in the middle of nature and away from the crowds. 
It''s about where do you want to wake up!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '156 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.71212, -9.14705, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.144166, 38.713835), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 0, 2, 1.0, 146.67, 36.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (83, 84, 'Apartment in the heart of Cascais, near the beach', 'Renovated apartment in downtown Cascais. Very charming and quite central, ideal for a couple with 2 small children. Close to a supermarket, pharmacy, restaurants, bars, ice cream parlors, pastry shops and bakeries, within a 100-meter radius.
Located in the bay of Cascais, 50 meters to the nearest beach, and 5 minutes walk from the Marina de Cascais.
Due to its location, guests will be able to hear music noise from nearby restaurants and bars
If you''re looking for peace and quiet, this isn''t the best area.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Cascais e Estoril', '49 Demo Street, Cascais e Estoril, Lisbon', 38.69743, -9.42085, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.420733, 38.701863), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 119.97, 36.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (84, 85, 'Shabby Chic 5 mins to Beach w/Huge Terrace', '-5 MINUTES WALK TO BEACH AND TRAIN STATION
-RESTAURANTS/CAFES AT DOORSTEP
-FREE STREET PARKING
-HUGE TERRACE
-SUPERFAST WIFI
-WORK FROM HOME
-LAUNDRY FACILITIES
-SPACIOUS & STYLISH 
-IDEAL FOR LONGER STAYS
-PRETTY NEIGHBOURHOOD

This large & modern 3 bedroom apartment is perfect for families. Located in the heart of Monte Estoril & walking distance to cafés, restaurants, and lovely little shops which gives it an authentic Portuguese-Village type feel', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Cascais e Estoril', '146 Demo Street, Cascais e Estoril, Lisbon', 38.7061, -9.40982, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.406037, 38.705593), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 4, 2.0, 284.33, 99.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (85, 86, 'Alfama Delight River& City Views AC 3Bedrs+2Baths', 'This unique, bright, and spacious first-floor apartment features stunning 180-degree views of the historic city and the Tagus River, located just meters away. It is strategically positioned in the heart of Alfama—Lisbon’s most authentic, beautiful, and historic neighborhood.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santa Maria Maior', '153 Demo Street, Santa Maria Maior, Lisbon', 38.71228, -9.13015, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.130508, 38.714699), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 3, 5, 2.0, 436.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (86, 87, 'Seaven Ericeira Beach Studio', 'Within walking distance of the iconic Ribeira d''Ilhas- World Surfing Reserve beach and a few minutes'' drive from the center of Ericeira village is Seaven Ericeira Beach Studio.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Ericeira', '14 Demo Street, Ericeira, Lisbon', 38.98212, -9.41317, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.411645, 38.981123), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 130.0, 17.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (87, 88, 'Casa da Âncora - Unique 5BDR Beachfront Property', '5 bedroom, 3 bathroom house in an exclusive location surrounded by the Atlantic, with a garden that extends to Praia Grande''s beachfront. The ideal place to stay while exploring Sintra''s magical atmosphere.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Colares', '25 Demo Street, Colares, Lisbon', 38.81751, -9.47504, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.472441, 38.819475), 4326)::geography, 9, false, 0, 5, 7, 3.0, 397.8, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (88, 89, 'FLH Anjos Cosy Place', 'Enjoy your stay in Lisbon in a very traditional neighborhood, full of different cultures, shops, restaurants and people. You''ll find a cosy apartment, with a personal décor, fully equipped to make your trip enjoyable and memorable.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '71 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.72254180908203, -9.134832382202148, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.136738, 38.721043), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 175.0, 18.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (89, 90, 'Heart of Lisbon modern apartment', 'The space
The apartment is located in a modern building in the Bairro Alto district, one of the oldest neighborhoods of Lisbon, where you will be able to enjoy most of Lisbon''s attractions by foot and surely combine comfort and elegance with the experience of the traditional Portuguese way of life. It is a place where you will certainly feel like being part of a sophisticated atmosphere in Lisbon.

The apartment

The apartment is high standard, located in a second floor with an elevator, and includes one bedroom, a living room with one double sofa bed, a complete kitchen with a balcony with all you need and a bathroom. 

The supermarket is just down the street of the apartment, and there are great restaurants, bakeries, small groceries and cafés in the area, as well as a pharmacy.

Amenities:

Bed room: 2 single bed (suitable for a couple or 2 friends);
Living room: 1 double sofa bed;
Sheets and bath towels include', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '69 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.7114, -9.14432, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.146036, 38.708582), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 150.5, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (90, 91, 'Home Out 4E - Apartment at City Center w/Parking', 'A 200m² Apartment, with 5 spacious bedrooms, 5 bathrooms, a living/dining room, a fully equipped kitchen and a laundry room. All rooms have air conditioning that works for heat and cold. 

Free parking spot.

Located on a traditional avenue, just a 1-minute walk from Alameda metro station (green and red lines), with a supermarket, restaurants, bank, pharmacy, and shops right at your doorstep.

Recommended for families and large groups looking to be close to the center of Lisbon.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Areeiro', '57 Demo Street, Areeiro, Lisbon', 38.73698, -9.13545, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.132068, 38.735805), 4326)::geography, 14, false, 0, 5, 8, 5.0, 666.0, 92.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (91, 92, 'Brilliant and Charming Apart Chiado-Bairro Alto', 'Welcome to Casa Portuguesa Combro! This wonderful apartment offers you modern decor in a historic Portuguese building where every detail has been designed with your comfort in mind. Located in the historic center of Lisbon, close to all the city''s tourist attractions, from Praça Luís de Camões, Chiado, Miradouro de São Pedro de Alcântara, Miradouro de Santa Catarina, Príncipe Real, Rossio, Baixa, Alfama, anyway... . Here it is right in the center of the historic center!!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Misericrdia', '158 Demo Street, Misericrdia, Lisbon', 38.71222, -9.14836, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.149178, 38.710891), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.0, 280.2, 29.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (92, 93, 'Seaview Luxury Apartment', 'Enjoy a privileged one bedroom apartment with ocean views from the balcony in a luxury condominium building. 

The fireplace creates a cozy environment in the living room, the garden and swimming pool will delight you in the summer days. A squash court is available for all sportspeople who want to get fit and enjoy the thrills of the sport and have fun.

The location of this place is magnificent, you are really close to the best bakeries, grocerie shops and restaurants in the area.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Cascais e Estoril', '118 Demo Street, Cascais e Estoril, Lisbon', 38.69879, -9.43843, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.43347, 38.699504), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 278.0, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (93, 94, 'FAMILY HOUSE - DREAM SPOT - 2207/AL', 'In a picturesque valley, the house, such a beautiful village! The ocean "at your feet." A popular beach, in the middle of large cliffs. From the top you can see everything, as if you were looking at “a postcard”. Very old village, whose origins are lost in time.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Colares', '112 Demo Street, Colares, Lisbon', 38.840667724609375, -9.46168041229248, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.462708, 38.840235), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 3, 1.0, 405.0, 69.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (94, 95, 'Country Village Senses - Casa de Madeira', 'Country Village Senses is a farm surrounded by nature, flora and fauna of an indigenous nature, the immense green landscape based on the Planalto das Cezaredas make the farm a unique space, excellent for an experience of tourism in rural areas.

This house is an integral part of the accommodation, has capacity for up to 4 people, divided into 2 bedrooms. It has a bathroom, kitchen and living room.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Reguengo Grande', '114 Demo Street, Reguengo Grande, Lisbon', 39.2947, -9.22785, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.225081, 39.291391), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 104.5, 17.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (95, 96, 'Estudio com terraço @ centro histórico Lisboa', 'Cozy, newly renovated and fully equipped apartment, next to Largo do Intendente and Avenida Almirante Reis, from where you can explore the entire historic area of the capital on foot.

It is located in a traditional Lisbon neighborhood, Intendente, with many restaurants, bars and supermarkets nearby.
Whether you are traveling alone or as a couple, this is the ideal apartment for your stay in Lisbon.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Arroios', '53 Demo Street, Arroios, Lisbon', 38.72063, -9.13369, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.134942, 38.720723), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 116.5, 34.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (96, 97, 'Park View Elevador de Santa Justa', 'The space
Since the early 20th century, the Santa Justa Lift has connected Baixa with Chiado and has become one of Lisbon’s most iconic landmarks, reflecting the city’s elegance and unique character.

Park View Lisbon has been completely renovated with an elegant design and high-quality materials, creating a sophisticated and welcoming atmosphere. It offers private, spacious, and carefully decorated rooms, equipped with flat-screen TVs and free high-speed Wi-Fi, ideal for relaxing after a day discovering Lisbon.

The apartment features a fully equipped shared kitchen with a coffee machine, refrigerator, and all necessary utensils, as well as a pleasant dining area perfect for relaxed breakfasts or informal dinners. The shared bathroom is modern and functional, with a shower, towels, and essential amenities, maintained to high cleanliness standards.

Located directly in front of Parque metro station, Park View Lisbon provides quick and easy acce', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Avenidas Novas', '158 Demo Street, Avenidas Novas, Lisbon', 38.73083, -9.14919, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.149174, 38.728774), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 71.0, 16.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (97, 98, 'Nice apartment with terrace', 'Nice apartment located between graca and Alfama. Just ten minutes walking from Santa Apollonia Train Station.
The apartament si modern. One bedroom With double bed and The dining room is equipped in order to host other two people.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'So Vicente', '179 Demo Street, So Vicente, Lisbon', 38.720988, -9.12343, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.122581, 38.722241), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 67.67, 0.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (98, 99, 'O Vale Lodge', 'Small Lodge completely surrounded by trees with a wodden deck facing the valley, the sea and a private garden with access to a 300 m2 ecopool.
Barbecue facilities avallable .', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santo Isidoro', '64 Demo Street, Santo Isidoro, Lisbon', 39.01276, -9.40356, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.402095, 39.011082), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 124.33, 19.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (99, 100, 'Aquilla Family Room 103 by Mycelia', 'This cozy room is the perfect starting point to explore Lisbon.

It’s located in the heart of the city, just a 10-minute walk from Avenida da Liberdade and Marquês de Pombal metro station. The area offers a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, and public transport, making it easy to access everything the city has to offer.

The bright and comfortable room provides a relaxing atmosphere — perfect for unwinding after a day out in the city.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Santo Antnio', '145 Demo Street, Santo Antnio, Lisbon', 38.72507, -9.14588, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.151018, 38.72338), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 2, 3.0, 81.5, 26.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01'),
  (100, 101, 'Room in the art''s house/ private bathroom/terrace', 'the ideal place to spend your holidays or business travels. the silence of the neighboorhood and the ideal terrace for your breakfast.
near the center, with a train and metro station near by.
very near the airport, 10 min by taxi, 15 by underground.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Lisbon', 'Areeiro', '6 Demo Street, Areeiro, Lisbon', 38.74362, -9.13539, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-9.132466, 38.741745), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 87.0, 9.0, 'EUR', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (101, 102, 'Designers Apartment in Nørrebro', 'Stay in a converted factory building, with lots of light and amazing furniture. Time out magazine voted Nørrebro the coolest neighborhoods in the world. The apartment is located 5 minutes to the nearest metro and has lots of cafe’s just around the corner.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '41 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.7003029, 12.5418976, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.538282, 55.698973), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2314.0, 336.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (102, 103, 'Modern and bright apartment in Carlsberg Byen', 'Very bright, calm and new apartment in Copenhagen’s best new district. 

It has one bedroom, one bathroom and a living-kitchen room with a terrace that receives direct sunlight until the afternoon. 

My apartment is simple and basic, perfect for those that plan to use it to rest while exploring the beautiful surroundings. 

Close to green areas, metro and train. The apartment is 10 min walk from both metro (Enghave Plads) and train (Carlsberg)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '82 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66851, 12.53624, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.536296, 55.665986), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2089.0, 349.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (103, 104, 'Absolutely fantastic. Nyhavn 100 meters', 'Absolutely fantastic. I love to live here.
Nyhavn 100 meters.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '103 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67439, 12.58938, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.590206, 55.675231), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 2.0, 3581.0, 866.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (104, 105, 'Elegant lejlighed i København', 'Enjoy a stylish experience in this centrally located home with the metro 2 minutes away. Only a few stops to Kongens Nytorv, Amager Strandpark, and the rest of Copenhagen. Cafés, restaurants, shopping, and grocery stores are right around the corner. The apartment is decorated in a calm Nordic style with bright rooms and a relaxing atmosphere - the perfect base for both a city break and a business trip.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '95 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.66415629999999, 12.599501, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.600446, 55.66718), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2995.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (105, 106, 'Hyggelig lejlighed i det centrale København', 'Enjoy a lovely stay in our cozy apartment in the heart of Copenhagen with Frederiksberg Have, Søndermarken and Copenhagen Zoo just around the corner. 

On the edge of Vesterbro you will find many of the city''s best restaurants, bakeries, parks, cafes, etc.

If you''re interested in the best restaurants and places to hang out, feel free to ask.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '106 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67078129999999, 12.5341879, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.531447, 55.672139), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1134.0, 147.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (106, 107, 'Generator - Bed in 8 Bed Dorm', 'Book a bed (or more) in our shared 8-Bed Dorm at Generator Copenhagen, ideal for social travellers. This room features 4 bunks (8 beds) and a private bathroom for added convenience. Each bunk is equipped with a personal light, shelf, USB charging station, and under-bed lockers. Pillow, duvet, and linen are provided. Towels are available at reception for a small fee. This room is for guests aged 18 and over only.asily access local hot spots from this hip place.', 'shared_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '63 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6858, 12.58357, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.588839, 55.686126), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 200.0, 53.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (107, 108, '140 kvm. på indre Nørrebro.', 'Family-friendly 140 sqm. Apartment in inner Nørrebro in Copenhagen, in quiet surroundings, 10 minutes walk from the lakes. Cozy and child-friendly courtyard environment. Surrounded by good eateries, bars and various supermarkets and shops. Space for 6 adults, divided into a bedroom (bed 180 x 200) + a guest room (bed 130 x 190) and the possibility of a double air mattress. 4 single duvets, as well as a double duvet available. Additional crib, bedside crib, and changing table.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '47 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.696, 12.5522, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.54688, 55.694203), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2909.0, 892.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (108, 109, 'Perfect 2 room flat in the center of Copenhagen', 'The apartment is bright and centrally located, with a bedroom overlooking a quiet courtyard area.

In the living room, you get the evening sun with a TV area and a workstation.
The sofa is not a sofa bed, but you can sleep on it. + 1 air mattress if there are 4 of you.

As a guest in this apartment, you are close to restaurants, museums, green parks and other cultural experiences. 

The apartment is a stone''s throw from Copenhagen K, Østerbro and the lakes.

Nørreport is 10 minutes away and here there is access to the subway, trains and buses.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '7 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.69358, 12.56846, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.564382, 55.691238), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1790.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (109, 110, 'Artistic bright loft,Central CPH', 'Welcome to our unique home, a hidden gem located on the 5th floor in the heart of Nørrebro. With a beautiful skylight and a south-facing balcony, our bright apartment is the ideal place for both single travelers and couples. Surrounded by trendy vintage and local specialty stores and with laundry around the corner, everything you need is right at your fingertips. And with the lakes of the bridges just a few steps away, there are plenty of opportunities for outdoor activities. We''re excited to welcome you to our beloved Nørrebro oasis!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '168 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.68987, 12.55864, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.560445, 55.691149), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1569.5, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (110, 111, 'Spacious apartment with private garden', 'A spacious apartment located in a quiet neighborhood in Frederiksberg. The apartment has its own private garden, with direct access to a playground in the backyard. Fully equipped kitchen, and with a washing machine and dryer. Which makes the apartment very child friendly. 

The apartment is located approx 600 meters from the nearest metro stop, thats easily takes you to the center of the city within 10-12 minutes. 

The neighbourhood is quiet, and with a broad range of nearby grocery stores.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '41 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.69111, 12.5336, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.526868, 55.689991), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1650.0, 385.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (111, 112, 'Copenhagen - wonderfull view over the harbour', 'Modern, bright apartment in Copenhagen with a lovely view of the harbor.
Only 50 meters to the quay, where you can swim and relax in the sun. Close to grocery shopping and just 100 meters to the Metro, with only a 5‑minute ride to central Copenhagen. Or explore the city by bike — the city of bicycles.
Four-room apartment with 1 bedroom and 2 additional rooms, both equipped with luxury sofa beds.
Large balcony with a grill and outdoor sofa.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '131 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.64769, 12.54435, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.542272, 55.647684), 4326)::geography, 6, true, 2, 3, 3, 1.0, 1940.25, 278.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (112, 113, 'Live in the heart of Nyhavn, Cph', 'Stylish 88 sqm apartment in iconic Nyhavn, offering historic charm and modern comfort. 

Features two bright rooms and a luxury bed, a sleek bathroom, fully equipped kitchen, and spacious living area with Danish design originals and a large rooftop where you can step back and enjoy the sun in complete quietness. 

Steps from top restaurants, cafés, and attractions like Amalienborg and Strøget. Ideal for couples, friends or business stays looking to experience the best of central Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '128 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67962458278875, 12.589345084655749, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.591518, 55.677488), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 3294.33, 456.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (113, 114, 'The perfect location', 'The home is close to Kongens Have, Strøget and Nyhavn in the Medieval Town in the most exclusive part of Copenhagen. Here you can feel
the city''s life and you''re close to everything. The building''s facade and roof are newly renovated in July 2025
As soon as you enter the apartment, you can feel the historic breeze.
Large kitchen with dining area, 2 bedrooms, a living room with dining table and a beautiful old tiled stove. Large bathroom, as well as a small guest toilet. 
The home is suitable for anyone who wants to live in the very center.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '15 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.681383, 12.580885, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.579612, 55.679439), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.5, 2627.0, 335.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (114, 115, 'Decant Flat in Central Copenhagen', 'Unwind in our charming 65-square-meter urban retreat, an inviting haven near Tivoli and the central station. Enjoy the convenience of a central, well-equipped space with easy access to attractions, dining, and transportation. Nestled on the fourth floor, it offers a lovely view, setting the scene for your urban escape. Fully furnished to ensure your comfort and enjoyment throughout your stay.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '100 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67095, 12.546286, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.547842, 55.674151), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 0, 2, 2.0, 1369.5, 424.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (115, 116, 'Nice apartment ideal for families', 'Nice and cozy apartment very central and close to everything. Ideal for families with small kids. 
The area provides supermarkets and restaurants within 2 minutes walk.

The room is big, with a big bed, a baby crib and TV with Chrome Cast .

There is a baby/toddler bed in the kids area as you can see on the pictures. 

You''ll share the flat with my roomie who is rarely here, and if so mostly in his room.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '81 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.68729, 12.55871, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.559404, 55.684122), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1031.6, 232.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (116, 117, 'Balkong ud til kanalen på smukke Christianshavn', 'Charming apartment in the lovely Christianshavn with beautiful balcony and direct view of the canal
The apartment is bright and spacious, contains two rooms and kitchen, with everything you need for a good vacation. 
Christianshavn is an old beautiful neighborhood where good cafés and restaurants are side by side. 
You are 10 minutes from Strøget on foot, 5 minutes from Christiania and 10 minutes from Cph Street Food. 
It is a 2-minute walk to the subway, bus and canal cruise.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '31 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6730667, 12.5922657, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.585128, 55.67304), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 2000.0, 341.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (117, 118, 'Nørrebro Oasis: Hipster Haven', 'Welcome to this charming 1 bedroom and livingroom apartment located in the heart of central Nørrebro. Nestled in a vibrant neighborhood, this cozy apartment offers a perfect blend of comfort and style. Within walking distance, you''ll find trendy restaurants, shopping options, and lively bars, allowing you to immerse yourself in the local culture. With its inviting atmosphere and convenient location, this apartment is the ideal retreat for those seeking an authentic experience of Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '157 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.6942075, 12.5451789, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.548332, 55.69504), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 2639.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (118, 119, 'Nice Little Room', 'My House is close to Grøndal station and bus 2A which takes you straight to the city center in 15min. Bus stop and train station is around the corner. There are also 4 diffrent supermarkets and a backery around the corner. The room is very good for singles and business traveler. 
I live in a charming old house from 1923', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vanlse', '177 Demo Street, Vanlse, Copenhagen', 55.69397, 12.5116, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.511903, 55.695554), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.5, 439.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (119, 120, 'Cosy flat in Christianshavn', 'Charming and newly renovated flat in vibrant Christianshavn. Close to Christiania, Central Copenhagen, Metro, and numerous cafés, wine bars, etcétera. Best spot in the city for a Copenhagen summer vacation. 

The flat consists of a living room in open connection with a kitchen, a large bedroom with a double bed (160x200 cm), a bathroom and an entrance with a small desk. All amenities are in the flat (dish washer, oven, washing machine, internet).', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '29 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6730567, 12.5927554, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.595891, 55.673429), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1433.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (120, 121, 'The heart of Copenhagen-Queen''s Neighbor', 'Lovely ground-floor apartment in the heart of Copenhagen-Excellent location, closest to the Danmark queen, perfect for couples but also ideal if you are traveling alone. You will be within walking distance of all key sights as well as shopping opportunities, cafes, and restaurants.

The quiet apartment has city views and free WiFi that comes with hardwood floors and features a fully equipped kitchen, a dining area, a flat-screen 55’ TV, and a private bathroom with a shower and toiletries.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '24 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68697, 12.5883, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.583009, 55.689628), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2178.0, 527.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (121, 122, 'Hyggelig og central Frederiksberg lejlighed', 'It is a classic 3-bedroom Frederiksberg apartment with black and white checkered kitchen floor and stucco in the ceiling.
This is a typical Copenhagen apartment with a cozy courtyard and a newly-renovated charming bathroom.

The apartment is located 5 minutes from the nearest metro, where the city center is 15 minutes away.
The area is relatively quiet, while close to Frederiksberg Have, the center and Nørrebro/Vesterbro.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '153 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68762, 12.5281, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.524713, 55.684532), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1098.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (122, 123, 'Roligt enpersons værelse på Frederiksberg', 'Enjoy a stay in a quiet setting in the middle of Frederiksberg. The apartment is a stone''s throw from the subway, and a short walk from Nørrebro and Vesterbro, so there is plenty to do in the neighborhood.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '29 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68657, 12.53608, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.533598, 55.686099), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 0.5, 894.5, 111.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (123, 124, 'Light and cozy apartment in FRB', 'Bright and nice apartment in the heart of Frederiksberg''s Svømmehalskvarter. The apartment has a nice courtyard where you can enjoy the lovely Danish summer evenings. The apartment is right next to Langelands Plads, where there is a swimming pool and playground, which makes the location ideal for people with small children, however, a crib would have to be brought.

The apartment is close to
Public transport and therefore also makes it good for people who want to enjoy Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '6 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68473, 12.52913, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.532496, 55.68116), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2497.17, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (124, 125, 'Lejlighed', 'Central and bright apartment, with room for 6 people to sleep, in a quiet building. 
Simple kitchen space with basic items such as pots, pans, cutlery, etc.
Mattress in the bedroom (140*200 cm) for two people.
Sofa bed in the living room; can be a regular sofa or a bed for two people (140*200 cm).
Mattress in a small room for two people (140*200 cm).
Toilet with bath and bath.
The kitchen and toilet are a bit old, but I enjoy living in the apartment, and I hope you will enjoy renting it when I''m not home.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '42 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.67969, 12.54657, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.545935, 55.680535), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 1399.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (125, 126, 'Nice 15 m2 balcony in a green garden', 'The charming 3 rooms apartment has a large balcony of 15 m2, which faces into a quiet and green courtyard.
The apartment is centrally located in Christianshavn a nice and cosy area in Copenhagen with metro and buses just outside the door.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '12 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.67073, 12.59323, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.595216, 55.670188), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1683.33, 248.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (126, 127, 'Dejlig lys lejlighed med altan', 'Accessible, with an elevator that also goes to the underground parking garage.
There is a balcony, a rooftop terrace, and a playground.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Valby', '1 Demo Street, Valby, Copenhagen', 55.65642, 12.50235, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.507292, 55.656685), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1198.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (127, 128, 'One bed room apartment close to Copenhagen center', 'Peaceful Apartment with Rooftop Access & Gym

Enjoy a peaceful stay just 15 minutes from the city center. This cozy one-bedroom apartment offers a comfy double bed, fully equipped kitchen, and modern bathroom. Guests have free access to the building’s gym and a spacious rooftop terrace with an outdoor shower — perfect for relaxing after a workout or exploring the city. Ideal for couples or solo travelers on a budget.

There is 3 meeting rooms and a big areas perfect for remote work.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '169 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.66813, 12.61505, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.610416, 55.665201), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 928.81, 308.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (128, 129, 'Lys og cute lejlighed m. altaner på hippe Nørrebro', 'Welcome to my pink apartment in the hip neighbourhood: Nørrebro in Copenhagen! The perfect place for a stay near by cozy cafes, restaurants, museums and public transportation. A light and homey apartment suitable for both couples and friends.
Enjoy your morning coffee in the sun at one of the balconies, discover small local places and connect easily with the rest of the city using the nearby metro.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Bispebjerg', '111 Demo Street, Bispebjerg, Copenhagen', 55.69997, 12.53662, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.535673, 55.697508), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1055.33, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (129, 130, 'Moderne lejlighed på Nørrebro.', 'Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '53 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.68913, 12.56376, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.562824, 55.687688), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1737.25, 546.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (130, 131, 'Perfect central apartment', 'Experience Copenhagen like never before! Our stylish flat not only offers proximity to the picturesque Nyhavn but also puts you within arm’s reach of all the city’s hotspots - from Kongens Nytorv and Amalienborg to the vibrant Strøget shopping street. With museums and the metro station just moments away, our centrally located haven ensures convenience at every turn. Don’t just visit Copenhagen - live it. Book your stay now and unlock the heart of the Danish capital!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '124 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6809, 12.59016, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.597078, 55.682064), 4326)::geography, 5, true, 2, 3, 3, 1.0, 4179.0, 1121.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (131, 132, 'Cozy lejlighed, på Vesterbro', 'Personal and cozy home with a central location in Vesterbro, surrounded by cafes, restaurants and bars. Experience a calm and homely atmosphere with the cat Monica as a roommate.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '104 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66528187163286, 12.548170728836059, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.546695, 55.662227), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 1533.25, 197.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (132, 133, 'Hyggelig lejlighed ved metro', 'Charming Copenhagen Apartment – Perfect for Couples

Cozy 3-room apartment at Amagerbro. Just a 7-minute walk to the metro and 1 minute to the bus, you''ll reach the heart of Copenhagen in no time. Christiania is a 5-minute bike ride away, and Strøget are only 10 minutes by bike.

The apartment features a spacious living room, dining area, a bedroom with a comfortable 160x200 cm bed. You''ll also have a balcony, WiFi, dishwasher, and washing machine.

No parties and no pets due to allergies.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '28 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.66595, 12.59857, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.602673, 55.665122), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1369.67, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (133, 134, 'Villa apartment close to downtown.', '80 m2. Close to Airport, Metro, shopping and beach. Three rooms. Dining Kitchen. Dishwasher. Internet. Washing machine in the basement.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '58 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.65912, 12.62094, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.624953, 55.66062), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1134.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (134, 135, 'Lovely apartment in Vesterbro, Copenhagen', 'Beautiful Copenhagen-apartment centrally located in the hip and modern Vesterbro.

The street is a cozy and quiet cobblestone street, but just around the corner the area is known for its vibrant life with restaurants, cafes and art shops, as well as the popular Meatpacking District. In addition, you are in a short distance to take a swim in the harbour, as well as beautiful gardens and parks. The metro station Enghave Plads is just around the corner.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '58 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66554, 12.55443, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.554174, 55.662703), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1733.0, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (135, 136, 'Cosy apartment next to the lakes and the park!', 'Cosy apartment next to the lakes and the park! Right in the city, 5 min away from the metro at Norreport, food courts at Israel square and city centre and urban Norrebro. Great spot for a couple to enjoy the city with easy access to most areas of Copenhagen.
NOTE - PLEASE MAKE SURE THAT YOUR PROFILE IS UPDATED AND VERIFIED VARIOUS WAYS AND HAS A DESCRIPTION OF WHO YOU ARE .
PLEASE STATE YOU ARRIVAL AND DEPARTURE TIME WHEN YOU MAKE YOUR REQUEST.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '180 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68327, 12.56345, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.563739, 55.682156), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1515.33, 427.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (136, 137, 'Big apartment w. balcony and close to lakes', 'Ideal for families or couples! In the attractive neighbourhood of Østerbro - 6 minutes walk from metro and 10 min walk from the station - near the lakes, The Little Mermaid and walking distance to the city lies this lovely 160m2 apartment with 5 rooms, huge kitchen with balcony and elevator to a beautiful garden.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'sterbro', '95 Demo Street, sterbro, Copenhagen', 55.69684, 12.58036, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.57849, 55.696877), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 3, 1.5, 2434.67, 301.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (137, 138, 'Charming, clean and modern Apartment w balcony', 'Welcome to our bright, clean and newly-renovated flat in the heart of vibrant Vesterbro! Just around the corner from the creative Meatpacking District with trendy restaurants, cafes, galleries, breweries, and cocktail bars. 5 minutes to the inner city.

Ideal for holidays, work trips, or longer-term stays. 2 mins walk from the train station (Dybbølsbro) - one stop from Copenhagen Central St - 500 m from the Metro St (Enghave Plads)

The perfect place for remote work or for your base to explore!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '26 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.6653444, 12.556088, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.554347, 55.661335), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1650.45, 0.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (138, 139, 'Nyhavn Canal Apartment', 'Welcome to our apartment situated in Copenhagen''s biggest attraction, Nyhavn. Immerse yourself in the vibrant tapestry of 17th-century facades, enjoy the bustling waterfront atmosphere, and savor a variety of Danish culinary delights right at your doorstep. With its dynamic views and convenient access to the city''s core and main attractions, our apartment serves as the perfect base for any purpose you have in mind.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '105 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.6812, 12.59121, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.592769, 55.678778), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 1886.0, 481.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (139, 140, 'Cosy Nørrebro apartment', 'A small and cozy apartment located in the heart of Nørrebro. The area is called Stefansgadekvarteret which is an area in Nørrebro with many bars, restaurants, local food and vintage shops. The apartment is also right next to Nørrebroparken - a park usually very full in the summertime with people hanging out but also in the colder months a popular little green area in an otherwise not so green part of the city. 

The apartment has a living room, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen and a balcony.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Nrrebro', '137 Demo Street, Nrrebro, Copenhagen', 55.69823, 12.54301, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.540432, 55.69557), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1099.0, 207.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (140, 141, 'Minimalistic family apartment', 'Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place at Amagerbro. 

5min walk to metro
10min to airport 
10min to city center
15min to beach

Open up the doors to the balcony and enjoy the evening sun and the atmosphere of a charming courtyard. 

The flat has new windows and doors, which isolates the noise from the street.

Living room, kids room and dining room has been thoroughly renovated, rest is in the process, but the entire apartment is fully functional.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '5 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.666275, 12.611675, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.606936, 55.666013), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2111.33, 396.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (141, 142, 'Komplet og central lejlighed', 'You will enjoy staying centrally in this one-bedroom apartment right by the water and harbor, inner city, shopping, bus and metro, cafes, restaurants and much more. The apartment has just what you need for a stay in Copenhagen. There is easy access to attractions, water, Amager fælled and shopping. There are a few meters down to a swim in the harbor and a few meters to a bus stop. It''s easy and quick to take the metro from the airport to the apartment. And only about twenty minutes walk to the center of Copenhagen.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager Vest', '99 Demo Street, Amager Vest, Copenhagen', 55.66441, 12.57668, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.581215, 55.660924), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1041.5, 200.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (142, 143, 'Skøn bolig ved Amager Strand', 'Stay with the whole family in our beautiful, romantic home right by the metro, the sea, and 10 minutes from downtown Copenhagen! 🌅', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '53 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.6578289, 12.6315348, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.633496, 55.657277), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 3236.75, 789.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (143, 144, 'Apartment central in Copenhagen', 'Entire apartment close to everything and with a large balcony.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '155 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67051, 12.55631, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.558643, 55.669828), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2180.33, 704.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (144, 145, 'Beautiful loft in the heart of Copenhagen', 'Beautiful loft, 3 rooms, 80 m2 in a historic building styled with Danish design classics and high-end amenities.

Located at Dronningens Tværgade, 1305 Copenhagen K (Her Majesty the Queens St.)', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Indre By', '149 Demo Street, Indre By, Copenhagen', 55.68376, 12.58399, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.579872, 55.686447), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 3082.0, 897.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (145, 146, '2 bedrooms - 5 people - close to metro - amager st', '== Rooms ==
Ground Floor:

Kitchen + living room: american coffee machine, dining table, dishwasher, exit to the balcony, freezer, fridge, oven, stove top, television, well equipped kitchen, armchair, internet, sofa, WIFI internet, smoke detector.
Bedroom 1: double bed (length: 2m, width: 1.8m), iron.
Bedroom 2: single bed (length: 1.95m, width: 0.9m), working desk, double bed (length: 2m, width: 1.4m).
Bathroom: basin, hairdryer, shower, toilet, dryer, washing machine.
Balcony: barbecue, ...', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '109 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.66421, 12.62672, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.625038, 55.663165), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 2, 3, 1.0, 2859.5, 734.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (146, 147, 'Cozy apartment at Vesterbro', 'This is an apartment for 2-3 persons. One bed for 2, one madras for 1 person. The apartment are located at Vesterbro at Sønder Boulevard, it is very quit and have a nice vibe with people sitting around drinking coffee at cafes. The area is close to Copenhagen city center, cafes, shops, and the cool meatmarket ''Kødbyen'' with a exciting nightlife and restaurants. Busses and S-trains is nearby.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '1 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.66534, 12.54542, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.545977, 55.667641), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1480.0, 360.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (147, 148, 'Seaview appartement in 1st row, 2 bedrooms', 'The flat is placed in Sluseholmen known as Copenhagen''s Venice and is placed close to the city center (4.5 km to central station) even though its a green area by the sea. 
Go by bike, public boat or bus to the city center.
The area is perfect for swimming, sun, green areas and sea experiences. 

You will love the flat because of the surroundings, the outdoor maritime area, cosy neighbourhood, the bright light in all the rooms in the flat and the comfortable bed.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '159 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.64611, 12.55194, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.554518, 55.645026), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2112.33, 570.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (148, 149, 'Stor, pæn - lidt gammeldags bolig', 'The property is from 1880, but has all modern amenities. 
The home is close to public transportation, bus, train and metro, as well as close to Tivoli and Frederiksberg Gardens. 
The neighborhood is known for its many good restaurants and its good atmosphere.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave', '130 Demo Street, Vesterbro-Kongens Enghave, Copenhagen', 55.67199, 12.54568, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.541106, 55.672877), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.0, 1373.0, 163.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (149, 150, 'Stylish Getaway in Frederiksberg', 'Prime Location: Just a few minutes’ walk from Frederiksberg’s best attractions, including the stunning Frederiksberg Gardens, trendy cafés, and local boutiques. The iconic Vesterbro district is also just a stone’s throw away, giving you easy access to the best of Copenhagen’s cultural scene.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Frederiksberg', '162 Demo Street, Frederiksberg, Copenhagen', 55.68544, 12.52951, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.528684, 55.681555), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1916.5, 308.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01'),
  (150, 151, 'Lejlighed i hjertet af Kbh.', 'Cozy 40 m2 apartment on the 3rd floor, 2.9 km from Nyhavn and 3.3 km from Tivoli. 8 min. by metro to the airport or Copenhagen city center. 5 min. walk to Lergravsparken Metro. Enjoy city life with shopping, restaurants, museums and music or walk along the beach 1 km away, play beach volleyball, swim or sail in kayak. 50 meters to grocery store and 1 km to Amagercentret. The apartment has a small bathroom with shower, kitchen with French balcony, cutlery, oven, stove, microwave. Living room with double bed and balcony.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Copenhagen', 'Amager st', '75 Demo Street, Amager st, Copenhagen', 55.66730430622864, 12.616394407409688, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(12.616308, 55.670118), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 916.5, 215.0, 'DKK', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

INSERT INTO listings (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city_id, neighborhood, address,
  latitude, longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds,
  bathrooms, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE
SELECT v.id, v.host_id, v.title, v.description, v.property_type, c.id, v.neighborhood, v.address,
  v.latitude, v.longitude, v.public_location, v.max_guests, v.pets_allowed, v.max_pets, v.bedrooms,
  v.beds, v.bathrooms, v.price_per_night, v.cleaning_fee, v.currency, v.created_at::timestamptz
FROM (VALUES
  (151, 152, 'Cosy Single Room (No window), heart of Stockholm', '• Single Room with No Windows, perfect for light travelers
• 8 m2 Average size
• 90 x 200 cm bed
• Tea Station
• Contactless access & 24/7 Customer service support
• Weekly professional cleaning
• Climate neutral and fully carbon offset
• Access to a gym nearby included
• Fast Wi-Fi
• Smart TV
• Each room is professionally cleaned to our 63-step"Ridiculously Clean" standard before your arrival. 
• Early check-in and late check-out are available upon request, with an extra fee.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '26 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31959, 18.04724, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.0474, 59.315997), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 806.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (152, 153, 'Charmigt sekelskifteshus nära sjö', 'A house built in 1924 with turn-of-the-century charm and several well-preserved original details. The house has three floors as well as a basement and offers many social areas for community with friends and family.

The house provides the opportunity for evening coziness in front of the fireplace, the balcony in the southwest-facing location for late summer evenings with sunset but also the loft floor for TV evenings or heated video game tournaments.

Welcome to the tall yellow house', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Älvsjö', '100 Demo Street, Älvsjö, Stockholm', 59.27541, 17.95832, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.95366, 59.278098), 4326)::geography, 8, false, 0, 4, 5, 1.5, 3106.33, 346.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (153, 154, 'Företagslägenhet i centrala Stockholm', 'HOMEstate is solely responsible for offering this listing on Airbnb, and they host as a business. For more legal information, visit our Help Center.

Business name: HOMEstate AB
Business registry: Swedish Trade and Industry Register
Registration number: 559179-2253
Email: reservations@homestate.se
Phone: +46 73 430 49 78
Address: Mogölsvägen 4, 55475, Jönköping, Sweden
To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '130 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31695, 18.07122, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.073438, 59.320365), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 1084.14, 276.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (154, 155, '50 m2 Private house near city, pool garden sauna!', 'Perfect for summer! Sauna, and you have the outdoor area inc pool - ALL to yourself!

Centrally located, completely newly renovated guest house with no/minimal visibility from the main house/neighbors near Stockholm. Free parking. Suitable for a couple, perhaps with 1 small child or a max 2 people if you use the sofa bed (120 cm). 

Calm and quiet. The office becomes a bedroom with a 120 cm bed, thick spring mattress with new bedding, double duvet. Wifi is fast, stable. Full kitchen, dishwasher', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Spånga-Tensta', '85 Demo Street, Spånga-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.376397588049244, 17.925313402130133, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.919683, 59.37778), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.5, 1536.33, 478.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (155, 156, 'Cosy Stockholm Get Away with Jacuzzi', 'In this newly build house you enjoy every moment. Its closeness to nature and Stockholm city makes it ideal for those who enjoy a city “get-away” - but still want to have city access. 

My new outdoor hot tub and tastefully furnished house is an oasis - relaxation and natural elements are combined and gives you a pleasant impression and feeling of design and comfort.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hässelby-Vällingby', '87 Demo Street, Hässelby-Vällingby, Stockholm', 59.36591, 17.82951, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.836683, 59.363567), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.5, 2925.0, 349.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (156, 157, 'Large One Bedroom Apartment', 'Welcome to our spacious one-bedroom apartment nestled in the heart of Old Town Stockholm!

This serviced apartment offers ample space and can accommodate comfortably up to 5 guests. Whether you''re traveling with family or friends, there''s plenty of room for everyone to unwind after a day of exploring.

The sitting area is generously sized, making it the perfect spot to gather and share your impressions from the day''s adventures.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '136 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32492, 18.06846, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.072864, 59.326221), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 1, 3, 1.0, 1868.58, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (157, 158, 'Own studio apartment with private room and bath.', 'This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Rinkeby-Tensta', '15 Demo Street, Rinkeby-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.40098954355272, 17.94274869752629, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.938524, 59.39798), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 759.33, 165.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (158, 159, 'Deluxe room (Twin bed)', 'EightRooms Hotel is in cozy and urban Södermalm. You can´t find a more ideal place at Södermalm to stay in, you have some of the best restaurants and parks in Stockholm in the area around Mariatorget and Slussen.

If you want to explore Stockholm, you have the metro 5 min walk from the place. You have the Old town and the Royal Palace just 10 min of walk away. It´s a modern and wonderful place in the middle of everything you want to see in Stockholm!', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '142 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31647, 18.08457, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.086651, 59.314328), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1197.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (159, 160, 'Studiolägenhet med stor takterrass & balkong', 'Unique and bright mini-two bedroom in the heart of Midsommarkransen with both a roof terrace and a king''s balcony – almost as much space outside as inside! Totally renovated 2020–2023 with cozy bedroom, stylish bathroom and open floor plan. Large windows and exits to patios from several rooms provide fantastic light. The subway is close – you are in the city in about 12 minutes. Perfect for a relaxing and inspiring stay in Stockholm!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '52 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.29969, 18.01035, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.015908, 59.302362), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2268.25, 493.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (160, 161, 'Pärlan på södermalm', 'Welcome to this cosy appartment in Södermalm!
The apartment has a bunk bed (210 cm * 95 cm) and a sofa bed that extends to a double bed (150 cm * 210 cm)
I recommend this for guests of 1-3 people, but for your knowledge you can sleep 5 people in the apartment. If you want to explore the city but want a kitchen with good equipment and very comfortable beds and good quality sheets. The apartment is located in Södermalm and close to the subway that takes you to the central station within 5 minutes', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '138 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31327, 18.0918, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.086715, 59.313679), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 0, 3, 1.0, 1090.5, 214.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (161, 162, 'Cozy & stylish flat, Old town Sthlm', 'Super nice little flat on first floor in 18th century house in the heart of Stockholm. From beautiful Prästgatan you enter this 42 sqm gem with one bedroom, a living room with a sofa that can be turned into 2 extra beds. Compact but fully equipped kitchen w dishwasher, stove, heater, fridge & freezer. Bathroom with wonderful Vola-shower and washing machine/dryer. Cozy and genuine Prästgatan on one side and busy and lively Västerlånggatan on the other. No car traffic makes the area very friendly!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '28 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32381, 18.07134, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.068431, 59.320037), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 2, 1.0, 2066.5, 227.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (162, 163, 'Cozy apartment in walking distance from Södermalm', 'As I split my time between Prague and Stockholm, I occasionally open my home to guests. 

It''s a peaceful, beautiful and authentic three room apartment with a sunny balcony, shared with my two lovely cats, Babeta and Dorota, who will happily keep you company during your stay.

Just 1 minute from Aspudden metro and 5 minutes from the city centre. 

This isn''t a typical Airbnb, but a much loved home, best suited for kind guests who enjoy authentic places and will treat it with care.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '91 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30689, 17.99822, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.996143, 59.303559), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 869.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (163, 164, 'Lovely sunny house near Stockholm C', 'I offer you a nice house with a sunny garden and terrace suitable for those wanting a spacious house not far from the city. The house has all the amenities you can wish for and is situated close to Stockholm City.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Spånga-Tensta', '76 Demo Street, Spånga-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.37251, 17.92467, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.919116, 59.370934), 4326)::geography, 5, false, 0, 3, 2, 0.5, 2430.75, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (164, 165, 'New modern Södermalm apartment', 'Spacious studio in the heart of trendy Södermalm, Stockholm! Features a fully equipped kitchen, high-speed WiFi, and a smart TV. Enjoy a cozy double bed and a sofa for extra comfort. 
Just 200m from the nearest subway, reaching the central station in minutes. 
A grocery store is a minute away, with cafés, restaurants, and a gym within 300m.
Fresh linens and towels provided for your convenience. Perfect for a comfortable and well-connected stay!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '10 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31908, 18.06663, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.071426, 59.316095), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1003.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (165, 166, 'Modern room close to nature, 30min from center', 'Private room in a modern well-equipped apartment:
- 9min walk to subway station, 20min subway to Old Town & Center
- Free Linens, towels, shampoo & shower gel, tea & coffee
- Microwave, hairdryer, washing & drying machine
- Pubs, restaurants (pizza, sushi, burger, grill, pastry) & shops nearby
- Outdoor gym and pool nearby
Please contact us for early check-in/late check-out. Only message on Airbnb app (no WhatsApp).
IMPORTANT: We have a very friendly and playful cat.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '102 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.26131, 18.02366, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.024819, 59.259228), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 253.35, 50.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (166, 167, 'Spacious studio in trendy Vasastan', 'Stay like a local in this bright studio apartment in relaxed St. Eriksplan. Here you''ll be surrounded by cozy cafés, neighborhood restaurants, and green spaces, in other words, a great spot to experience everyday Stockholm. 

The area offers a peaceful vibe, yet you’re just minutes from the city center—with direct airport transport nearby for extra convenience.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '159 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.33846, 18.03183, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.034489, 59.341525), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 0, 2, 1.0, 1720.1, 362.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (167, 168, 'Mysig lägenhet i Sofo', 'Cozy apartment of 36 sqm in the heart of Södermalm. Close to bars, restaurants, cafés, small streets and shopping. 
Windows facing the lush courtyard allow you to leave the bustling street to be welcomed by a quiet apartment. 
The nice courtyard offers barbecue and dining areas.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '37 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31255, 18.07584, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.067979, 59.311162), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 2282.5, 789.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (168, 169, 'Cosy', 'Room located in a serene, clean and illuminated accommodation located 2 minutes from the metro station. Quiet place with some shops, restaurants, 10 minutes from downtown and close to nature.

Internet, electricity and water included.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skarpnäcks', '100 Demo Street, Skarpnäcks, Stockholm', 59.28614, 18.1126, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.10539, 59.287972), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 2.0, 617.0, 191.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (169, 170, 'En mysig 2:a nära till allt.', 'A fresh, large 2-room apartment with an open floor plan, the balcony is perfect for those who like to live both centrally and close to water and nature. Nearby there are shops and cozy restaurants. A stone''s throw from Södermalm.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '167 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.30653, 18.02818, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.027617, 59.308717), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1791.0, 277.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (170, 171, 'Heart of Södermalm | Walk Everywhere | 2BR Apt', 'Stay in the heart of Södermalm, one of Stockholm’s most vibrant neighborhoods. Cafés, restaurants, vintage shops, parks, and viewpoints are all just steps away.

This bright 2-bedroom apartment is the perfect base for exploring the city. Walk to the waterfront, trendy streets, and reach Gamla Stan and the metro within minutes.

Everything you need for a comfortable stay is right outside your door.

Perfect for couples, friends, or families exploring Stockholm.

Learn more below!', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '138 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31718, 18.07301, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.077575, 59.319907), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2938.0, 449.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (171, 172, 'City Twin Room with Private Bathroom - No Window', 'Stockholm Hostel is an Airbnb hostel that offers accommodation in private rooms with private shower and toilet. There''s also a shared kitchen where guests can cook with other guests. Bed linens and towels are included in the price.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '17 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33515, 18.03194, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.037318, 59.334393), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.5, 999.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (172, 173, 'Cozy Design Studio Flat Close to Stockholm City', 'Welcome to a cozy and fully equipped apartment in a quiet residential area in Enskede. Perfect for couples, small families business travelers who want to stay close to the city while still enjoying peace and quiet.
Family-friendly with parks and green areas, private entrance and access to a garden patio. Parking available at SEK 120 per day.
The Skogskyrkogården metro station is just a few minutes away, with fast connections:
Södermalm – 10 min
Central Station, Arlanda Express – 15 m', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '20 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.28047, 18.09318, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.088758, 59.281354), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1084.5, 137.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (173, 174, 'Nice apaartment in the city center of Stockholm', '120m2 big flat in the center of Stockholm,a basement flat a half floor down with own entrance door.(you dont get the same daylight)Close to the metro station that transport you all over the city,Close to bars, shopping and supermarkets.walkingdistance to the centralstation,2 stops with metro.the apartment have two bedrooms one with a doublebed and one with two singlebeds and one double bedsofa ,one childbed.if wanted we can arrange for one more person to sleep in the sofa in the livningrrom.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '97 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.34091, 18.06089, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.059586, 59.341981), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 4, 1.5, 3780.0, 422.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (174, 175, 'Charming attic studio in trendy Södermalm', 'Elias is solely responsible for offering this listing on Airbnb, and they host as a business. For more legal information, visit our Help Center.

Business name: Guestit AB
Business registry: Swedish Trade and Industry Register
Registration number: 5591192678
Email: guest@guestit.se
Phone: +46 8 35 65 64
Address: Lützengatan 12A, 115 20, Östermalm, Sweden
To help protect yourself from fraud, always use Airbnb to send money and communicate with hosts.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '63 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31762, 18.06702, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.063315, 59.317171), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 2121.3, 418.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (175, 176, 'Room with private bathroom, Stockholm', 'Female guest only, suitable for students. I prioritize 3-4 months rentals.
Your own room with private bathroom, shared kitchen and access to sunny terrace.
Close by are food stores, pharmacy, restaurants and cafés.
1 min walk to the Metro in Bagarmossen, 10 min from the hip district of Södermalm, 20 min to the Central Station.
I live here with 2 teenagers every other week and the cat Tindra.

I provide bed linen, pillows, blankets, towels. You get a starter kit with soap and toilet paper.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skarpnäcks', '84 Demo Street, Skarpnäcks, Stockholm', 59.27761, 18.134, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.137118, 59.280003), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 321.07, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (176, 177, 'Nice apartment in the city center', 'Several restaurants in the building. Could be some fragrance sometimes in the apartment - for the most part in the summer.
1 stop from centralstation with the underground. Close to the water. A big bed for 2 and a big sofa for 1 and a bedside cabinet. Extra toilet. Free WI-FI, Stereo - Blue tooth.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '130 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.32881, 18.03559, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.041537, 59.330859), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 4, 2.0, 1751.5, 359.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (177, 178, 'Amazing 3 BR.Perfect for families!', 'Our beautiful apartment in a house from 1906 is newly renovated. We have three large bedrooms, a combined livingroom/kitchen and a bathroom with shower/bathtub.

It is situated in the best location on Södermalm, close to shops, restaurants and bars', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '29 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31434, 18.06096, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.05683, 59.314267), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.5, 4496.33, 727.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (178, 175, 'Compact Studio in Trendy Neighborhood', 'This well-located studio in Hornstull places you close to the waterfront in one of Södermalm’s most vibrant neighborhoods. Ideal for culturally curious couples, it’s surrounded by cafés, bars, and local markets. The metro provides fast access to the city center, and a nearby bus offers a direct connection to Arlanda Airport.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '127 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31775649999999, 18.0265458, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.022538, 59.3208), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 0, 2, 1.0, 1701.4, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (179, 179, 'Cozy and close to Farsta centrum apartment', 'Hello,
We rent out room/rooms in our apartment. The apartment consists of 4 rooms and a kitchen on an area of 93 / m2. There is two bathrooms and a balcony as seen in the pictures.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Farsta', '130 Demo Street, Farsta, Stockholm', 59.24559, 18.08344, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.08176, 59.243526), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 2.5, 889.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (180, 180, 'Generator - Bed in 6 Bed Dorm', 'Sharing is caring – get ready to make some friends.

- Book one bed (or more) in this shared room
- 3 bunks – 6 beds
- Private bathroom 
- All bunks include a light feature, personal shelf, charging station with USB port, and under-bed lockers
- Pillow, duvet, linen all supplied
- Towels available at reception for a small fee
- Over 18''s only', 'shared_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '172 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.3366, 18.04919, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.051558, 59.340698), 4326)::geography, 1, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 253.0, 49.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (181, 181, 'Luxurious Penthouse Apt (1700sqft)', 'Modern penthouse apartment in building from 1913, with private terrace and fireplace in trendy, central area. Comfortable and bright in Scandinavian design, with 4 separate bedrooms and sofa bed in the living room. Restaurants, shops, nightlife, parks and swimming areas within a few minutes walk.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '76 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.31826, 18.03141, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.03223, 59.321772), 4326)::geography, 8, true, 2, 4, 5, 1.5, 4543.2, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (182, 182, 'The travelers'' "warm home” in Stockholm', 'My place is close to public transport (to the city downtown about 40 minutes), family-friendly activities,and the Airport in Bromma (10minutes by car), Arlanda (30 minutes by car) . You’ll love my place because of a representative house with warm and cozy decoration, plus beautiful back and front yards, a big living room and party hall, as well as the most enthusiastic hostess. My place is suitable for 1 or 2 female travelers to lovely Stockholm for a short relaxation or inspiration.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Spånga-Tensta', '119 Demo Street, Spånga-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.36919, 17.89576, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.900053, 59.36877), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.5, 470.0, 146.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (183, 183, 'Spacious room in the heart of Stockholm', 'Welcome to our spacious guest room in the heart of Stockholm on Södermalm. Relax in your 140cm bed and make use of your workspace if needed. 

Enjoy Södermalm''s vibrant atmosphere, retro shops, hip bars, and beautiful parks. Our apartment is right by the subway, close to the waterfront, next to bars and restaurant and just 5 minutes away from the central station.', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '119 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.30919, 18.07686, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.074032, 59.309947), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1223.5, 131.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (184, 184, 'Hotell Lägenhet - The Studio Hotel', 'Perfect hotel for a longer stay in central Kista - only 13 minutes from Stockholm. Large rooms with kitchen with pots and pans as well as porcelain, high-quality comfort in Jensen beds. The rooms are well-equipped and also offer Chromecast. Free parking, laundry room, gym and sauna, and games room. For an extra cost, there is an option to add breakfast to be served every day in our lounge on the 8th floor.
Cleaning is done weekly, where we also change towels and sheets', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Rinkeby-Tensta', '59 Demo Street, Rinkeby-Tensta, Stockholm', 59.3992, 17.95358, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.953415, 59.401824), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 1200.0, 346.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (185, 185, 'Traditional Country House in the City', 'This accomodation is in a classified nineteenth-century Swedish country house very close to the city and the subway. Cosy and romantic old fashioned appartment in traditional area just outside the port of Stockholm that has an ambiance of a small town. Private upper floor with two beds twelve minutes with subway from Stockholm Central station. Perfect for a single person, a couple with a small baby. Like being on the country side, but on the same time in the middle of the city.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '136 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.3059, 17.99958, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.999046, 59.307923), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 960.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (186, 186, 'Beautiful Spacious Apartment', 'Welcome to our charming 50-52 SQM Superior studios, that are located on Slussen, between the Old Town and the vibrant district of Södermalm. The four Superior studios are located on floors 1 to 4 and offers free Wi-Fi, a flat-screen TV and a kitchenette. You live just a minute from restaurants, shops and public transport. The apartments are located in a building from the 1650s and has high ceilings and lovely stucco. There is also a dining table with chairs and a modern bathroom with a shower. T', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '118 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32087, 18.07023, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.06704, 59.322002), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1220.81, 144.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (187, 187, 'Lovely & cozy apt in Kungsholmen', 'Welcome to this modern apartment in Kungsholmen!
The apartment has an bed Queensize (140cm) and a sofa.
I recommend this for guest between 1-2 people, but for your knowledge it you can sleep 3 people in the apartment If you want to Explore the city but wants a kitchen with good equipments and very comfortable beds and great Quality of bed sheets. The apartment is located in Kungsholmen and near subway that takes you to the central city station within 5 minutes', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '101 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33311, 18.02574, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.030716, 59.331666), 4326)::geography, 3, false, 0, 0, 1, 1.0, 1113.0, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (188, 188, 'Convenient studio in residential area', 'This convenient studio offers a relaxed stay in Stora Essingen, a quiet residential island just outside the city center. It’s a great option for guests looking to experience a more local side of Stockholm—close enough to explore downtown, but far from the busy streets. Take a peaceful walk along the waterfront loop around the island, or catch a bus and reach the central station in about 20 minutes.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '77 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.32387, 17.98726, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.986948, 59.322312), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 0, 3, 1.0, 1255.45, 406.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (189, 189, 'Entire apartment with ocean view', 'Discover charm in our 1-bedroom Kungsholmen apartment, a 4-minute walk from the water. Enjoy a cozy atmosphere with a queen-size bed (bedroom has ocean views) and a comfy couch. Benefit from high-speed Wi-Fi, a smart TV, and gaming consoles (PS4, Switch, PS3). Luxuriate in the heated floor bathroom, and appreciate the newly renovated kitchen with modern appliances. The space is adorned with plush carpets and LED lights, ensuring the perfect ambiance, specially in the evenings.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Kungsholmens', '175 Demo Street, Kungsholmens, Stockholm', 59.33432, 17.99994, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.996874, 59.336269), 4326)::geography, 2, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1266.8, 170.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (190, 190, 'Modern townhouse near lake and 15 min to city', 'Welcome to our Modern townhouse built 2019 situated 15 min from Stockholm city and close to nature in a calm area with nearby communications. The house has three bedrooms and an open living room with a kitchen. Each floor has a bathroom and television. The master bedroom has a 160 cm bed, the second a 120 cm, and the downstairs an 80 cm bed. Outside, the terrace has furniture and barbeques. Ten minutes walk there is a large mall with everything you need for your stay and the train/metro to town', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Farsta', '54 Demo Street, Farsta, Stockholm', 59.23563, 18.09016, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.087808, 59.238849), 4326)::geography, 4, true, 2, 3, 3, 2.0, 2663.0, 839.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (191, 186, 'Beautiful apartment located in Slussen', 'This cozy 33 sqm studio is located between the Old Town and the vibrant district of Södermalm. The studio offers free Wi-Fi, a flat-screen TV, and a kitchenette. You’ll be just a minute away from restaurants, shops, and public transport.

Situated in a building dating back to the 1650s, the apartment features high ceilings and beautiful stucco details, with a view towards the street by the entrance. It also includes a dining table with chairs and a modern bathroom with a shower.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '36 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.32071, 18.06874, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.071009, 59.318678), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 3, 3.0, 1093.48, 374.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (192, 191, 'Nice house in great scenary', 'Very nice house on quiet and cozy street in a good neighborhood. Very good connection both by car and public transportation. Close to Stockholm city (15 min by subway) and walking distance to beautiful nature, forest and lakes. 
An old house in modern style and in great condition. The house can easily fit two families with its 5 bedrooms and big kitchen.
You can find supermarkets, bakery, restaurants and other stores in Kärrtorps centrum just a 5 minute walk from the house. 
Free parking.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Skarpnäcks', '122 Demo Street, Skarpnäcks, Stockholm', 59.27837, 18.11211, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.106715, 59.277881), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 5, 6, 3.0, 3508.4, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (193, 192, 'Spacious, bright, unique apartment', 'This unique apartment is situated in Vasastan, with great restaurants, trendy bars and coffee shops just outside the door. Built in 1915, the apartment has an open architecture, with a modern interior design and inspiring art and paintings.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Norrmalms', '134 Demo Street, Norrmalms, Stockholm', 59.34685, 18.06056, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.059772, 59.343108), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 3, 4, 1.5, 5515.0, 1508.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (194, 193, 'Bohemian Apartment – [Female Guests Only]', 'Welcome to my charming and peaceful apartment, perfect for women travelers! Located on the bottom floor. Just a short walk to the city’s best spots, my place is a perfect base for exploring Stockholm. 

The apartment includes everything you’ll need for a comfortable stay—high-speed Wi-Fi, a fully equipped kitchen with tea, coffee, and a kettle, as well as a bathtub. 

Guests have rated me +4.5 stars for 9 years experience and a very stable host! Feel free to reach out if you have any question 💛', 'private_room'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '95 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.295059, 17.996189, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.998054, 59.294499), 4326)::geography, 1, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 773.45, 0.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (195, 175, 'Bright Flat w/ Balcony in Quiet, Central District', 'Make the most of your Stockholm stay from this bright and homey apartment. Located in an upscale, peaceful neighborhood, it’s the ideal starting point for city adventures and relaxed strolls through nearby green fields. With excellent public transport connections, you’re never far from cultural landmarks, waterfront promenades, and vibrant shopping streets. Whether you''re visiting for work or a weekend getaway, this apartment offers the perfect mix of comfort and convenience.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Östermalms', '135 Demo Street, Östermalms, Stockholm', 59.34583, 18.09532, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.095988, 59.347947), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 2, 2, 1.0, 2949.97, 487.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (196, 194, 'Cozy tiny house near Globen-The Swedish experience', 'This cozy Swedish tiny house is situated in Stockholms quite, peaceful and picturesque garden city just a few minutes by metro from Stockholm city center. Easy to reach by public transport or car:
 - 5 min walk to "Ericcson Globe" (concerts, shopping mall, restaurants, metro station) 
- 10-15 min to Söder, SOFO, central station (airport link) 
Newly renovated, fully equipped kitchen with everything you may need.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '84 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.29091, 18.06801, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.066146, 59.294346), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 1458.0, 356.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (197, 195, 'Mysig gästlägenhet i villa', 'Welcome to our charming guest apartment on the ground floor of our villa! Perfect for a relaxing stay with all the amenities you need.

The bright and airy apartment offers a modern kitchen/living room, an elegant bathroom and a cozy bedroom. It has its own private entrance and a lovely patio.

The kitchen is fully equipped. In the living room, there is a comfortable sofa bed that can accommodate two people. In the bedroom, there is a double bed. 

Distance to subway 2 minutes, which takes 20 minutes to City.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs', '83 Demo Street, Enskede-Årsta-Vantörs, Stockholm', 59.27557, 18.05477, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.05116, 59.274728), 4326)::geography, 4, false, 0, 1, 2, 1.0, 801.0, 236.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (198, 196, 'Magnifik utsikt över Mälaren Gröndal/Ekensberg', 'Here you live in a new apartment (2018) with 5 room of 116 sqm with a lake view. Large balcony (31 sq.m.) with a front position right by Lake Mälaren. Below there is a bathing jetty and nice walking paths close to nature and the town. Located in lovely Gröndal/Ekensberg.
Walk 400 m to the shuttle boat that takes you to Stockholm City Hall in 15 min. Or by bus from Bryggvägen to Liljeholmen and then the subway into the city.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hägersten-Liljeholmens', '87 Demo Street, Hägersten-Liljeholmens, Stockholm', 59.31679829999999, 17.9976308, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.99764, 59.312731), 4326)::geography, 6, false, 0, 4, 4, 2.0, 4715.0, 1061.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (199, 197, 'Historically protected duplex', 'This historically protected building offers a duplex appartement with 5m celing hight. Furnished with luxury furniture and beautiful art, perfekt for you who love to be surrounded by beauty. Uppstairs bedroom, Big bathroom,tv, speakers in every room, Wi-Fi, coffee mashine and in the middle of Sofo, infront of a beautiful Church, Just 2 min Walk från Slussen Subway, 1 min från Medborgarplatsen and 5 min från hipp Nytorget area. Here you will experience the hippest part of Stockholm.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Södermalms', '135 Demo Street, Södermalms, Stockholm', 59.3159792, 18.076814, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(18.077975, 59.319357), 4326)::geography, 2, false, 0, 1, 1, 1.0, 3906.67, 466.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01'),
  (200, 198, 'Cozy studio close to nature withgood communication', 'Very cozy studio with everything you can possibly want and need if you want to stay at home. Romantic, inspired by nature. 

Feel at home and spoil yourself with a movie night or take the subway 30 min to the city center and explore Stockholm.', 'entire_place'::property_type, 'Stockholm', 'Hässelby-Vällingby', '53 Demo Street, Hässelby-Vällingby, Stockholm', 59.37267, 17.84627, ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(17.851417, 59.375125), 4326)::geography, 3, true, 2, 1, 1, 1.0, 1910.0, 602.0, 'SEK', '2018-01-01')
) AS v(id, host_id, title, description, property_type, city, neighborhood, address, latitude,
  longitude, public_location, max_guests, pets_allowed, max_pets, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms,
  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, currency, created_at)
JOIN cities c ON c.name = v.city;

